      "description": "The package that makes the trip: three days of unlimited vertical in the Selkirk & Monashee mountains, out of town since 1978, with everything handled.\n\n**9,000 m guaranteed**, unlimited metres included — the Bell 212 takes up to 10 guests (2–3 groups per aircraft), so our group of 3 fits easily with room to spread out.\n\nSki days Sun–Tue (Feb 21–23), check-in Saturday Feb 20, **4 nights at the Coast Hillcrest Hotel, all meals included**. ACMG/IFMGA guides, powder ski & snowboard fleet, avalanche airbags + safety gear, Acera emergency medical cover.\n\n**Price: $8,469 CAD + 5% tax ≈ €5,880 pp** in the Feb window (Jan 31 – Mar 6 rate). Availability confirmed for our dates — 35% deposit secures.",
